///
/// @file p10_pm_elog.H
/// @brief This hardware procedure allows users to:
///        1. get a list of PM error log entries generated by any of the PM
///           engines (PGPE, XPGE or QME),
///        2. read one or more error logs specified in the list, and
///        3. purge one or more error logs specified in the list
